<Layout title="Cookie Policy" description="Learn how the Vera Health Notes website loads and which third-party services it uses.">
  <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
  <div class="copy">
    <p>Vera Health Notes does not set first-party cookies for accounts, advertising, or newsletter subscriptions. Cloudflare delivers the site and may use security or traffic-management features as needed to protect it.</p>
    <p>Our pages request typefaces from Google Fonts. These requests go to Google and involve ordinary connection information. Your browser can block cookies or third-party requests through its own settings.</p>
    <p>The <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a> explains how the site and its providers handle technical information. This page will be updated if we introduce a service that changes these practices.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
